<title>NORWAY: Elf to restart Froey oilfield after maintenance.</title>
<headline>Elf to restart Froey oilfield after maintenance.</headline>
<dateline>OSLO 1997-06-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Elf Petroleum said on Monday the North Sea Froey oil and gas field would resume production in the next day or two following scheduled maintenance.</p>
<p>Froey, which pumped 30,710 barrels per day of oil in May, was shut in on June 8.</p>
<p>&quot;We will restart (production) either on Tuesday or Wednesday,&quot; a spokesman for the company said.</p>
<p>The turnaround coincided with maintenance at the Lille Frigg oil, condensate and gas field, he said.</p>
<p>-- Tanya Pang, Oslo newsroom, +47 22 42 50 41</p>
